Reliance is placed upon the following judgments:
i. Major General Kapil Mehra Vs. UOI, 176 (2011) DLT 361;
ii. Sri Ram M. Vijayalakshamma Rao Bahadur Ranee of Vuyyur Vs. Collector of Madras C.A. No. 410 of 1962, decided on 24.04.1963, by Hon'ble Supreme Court; and iii Pratap Singh, through LRs. Vs. UOI & Ors.
